e\\nsnapshots, or organisms/databases that are not directly supported by an\\ninstalled Galaxy enrichment wrapper. KEGG REST mode can download a current KEGG\\norganism mapping when network access is available to the Galaxy job.</p>\\n<p>The p-value adjustment family can be all pathways with at least one gene in the\\nuniverse, or only pathways with at least one foreground hit. The summary output\\nrecords the mapping source, mapping hash, background mode, adjustment family,\\nuniverse size, foreground size, and pathway counts used in the run.</p>\\n<p>The contributing-genes output has one row per foreground gene that maps to a\\npathway and is useful for counting which genes contribute to a selected pathway.</p>\\n\",\n    \"help_format\": \"restructuredtext\",\n    \"hidden\": \"\",\n    \"hidden_versions\": [],\n    \"history_id\": \"bbd44e69cb8906b569c5fee6ffb7a884\",\n    \"icon\": null,\n    \"id\": \"toolshed.g2.bx.psu.edu/repos/goeckslab/kegg_ora/kegg_ora/0.1.0+galaxy1\",\n    \"inputs\": [\n        {\n            \"argument\": null,\n            \"default_value\": {\n                \"values\": [\n                    {\n                        \"id\": \"f9cad7b01a47213554954817c50ba265\",\n                        \"src\": \"hda\"\n                    }\n                ]\n            },\n            \"edam\": {\n                \"edam_data\": [\n                    \"data_0006\",\n                    \"data_0006\"\n                ],\n                \"edam_formats\": [\n                    \"format_3475\",\n                    \"format_2330\"\n                ]\n            },\n            \"extensions\": [\n                \"tabular\",\n                \"txt\"\n            ],\n            \"help\": \"\",\n            \"help_format\": \"html\",\n            \"hidden\": false,\n            \"is_dynamic\": false,\n            \"label\": \"Foreground gene list\",\n            \"model_class\": \"DataToolParameter\",\n            \"multiple\": false,\n         